	(text "C1/C2 at J10: the clamp diodes return ESD current into +3V3.\nJ10/J11: Samtec ESQ stacking sockets (top side, tails through to the card below). Pad k\ncarries bus pin stack_bus.socket_pin(k) (KiCad socket columns are mirrored). Signals this\ncard does not use pass through the connector. +5V is not used on this card."
